00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:04.716
And it happened because, in my view, of the three key
factors that underpin our approach to change vision, execution,

00:20:05.116 --> 00:20:11.236
and values. Let me explain briefly why
these three factors made the difference.

00:20:11.756 --> 00:20:19.036
First, vision with AI. Singapore
has been clear minded about our direction.

00:20:19.396 --> 00:20:27.036
We launched our first national AI strategy in 2020 2019,
and that was even before ChatGPT was invented.

00:20:27.596 --> 00:20:33.836
We then refreshed it with national AI strategy 2.0 in 2023,

00:20:34.436 --> 00:20:39.476
as breakthroughs in the large
language models accelerated what AI could do.

00:20:40.156 --> 00:20:43.356
And most recently, we strengthened our framework

00:20:43.396 --> 00:20:50.156
and governance framework by establishing a national
AI Council chaired personally by the Prime Minister

00:20:50.676 --> 00:20:53.916
and the four missions that Priscilla mentioned throughout.

00:20:54.396 --> 00:21:03.636
We have been guided by a simple but also clear vision AI
for the public good for Singapore and the world.

00:21:05.116 --> 00:21:10.556
To realize this vision, our strategy
focuses on three things building capabilities,

00:21:11.036 --> 00:21:19.916
strengthening our digital and cloud infrastructure,
and providing funding support to help companies scale and adopt AI.

00:21:20.756 --> 00:21:28.036
But strategies only alone will not help our people
to succeed and not help our business to succeed.

00:21:29.036 --> 00:21:32.436
Strategies only succeed when people can apply them.

00:21:32.436 --> 00:21:41.916
So we must also equip Singaporeans with the skills,
confidence and practical know how to turn these investments into real,

00:21:42.156 --> 00:21:43.476
tangible outcomes.

00:21:44.596 --> 00:21:53.236
Second, execution strategy creates impact when it is executed
well on the ground and across the economy.

00:21:53.636 --> 00:21:58.236
This is where partnerships and ecosystem building become critical.

00:21:59.036 --> 00:22:04.076
Government can set direction. It is the industry that drives adoption.

00:22:04.476 --> 00:22:10.796
NTUC does play a convening role by
bringing together companies and workers,

00:22:10.996 --> 00:22:15.276
so that transformation is both practical and inclusive.

00:22:16.036 --> 00:22:20.556
One initiative by NTUC is our Company Training Committee or CTC.

00:22:20.596 --> 00:22:29.156
In short. Through CTC, we work closely
with company management to identify how AI can improve productivity,

00:22:29.476 --> 00:22:33.476
redesign jobs, and equip workers for higher value jobs.

00:22:34.196 --> 00:22:37.956
To date, more than 3800 CTCs have been formed,

00:22:38.316 --> 00:22:45.316
benefiting enterprises across different
sectors and also uplifting over 300,000 workers.

00:22:45.956 --> 00:22:54.396
Government set aside $300 million to support NTUC,
CTC grants for business transformation and workforce development.

00:22:54.996 --> 00:23:04.036
Let me share two concrete examples with you so you
understand how CTC can help. A local agri business and an agriculture.

00:23:04.276 --> 00:23:10.476
Implemented a CTC project to deploy an AI enabled automation system.

00:23:11.116 --> 00:23:20.036
This reduced manual data entry and improved coordination across
operations, Providing real time visibility across the supply chain.

00:23:20.716 --> 00:23:27.116
At the same time, workers were reskilled,
jobs were redesigned, and workers were strengthened,

00:23:27.676 --> 00:23:30.756
their digital and data handling capabilities.

00:23:31.476 --> 00:23:38.236
The productivity gains were shared with workers
through a 5% wage increment for about 100 employees.

00:23:39.396 --> 00:23:41.916
In a different sector, we see similar impact.

00:23:42.196 --> 00:23:49.396
BDO Tax Advisory embarked on a digitalization initiative
to automate its back office processes,

00:23:49.676 --> 00:23:53.956
which significantly improved productivity and client responsiveness.

00:23:54.676 --> 00:24:00.516
Employees could thus focus on higher value
work and spend less time on repetitive tasks.

00:24:00.996 --> 00:24:10.556
As a result, 70 workers from BDO received a 5% wage increment,
alongside new opportunities for long term career development.

00:24:11.316 --> 00:24:16.116
And this is how CTC works in practice, helping companies transform,

00:24:16.276 --> 00:24:23.076
upgrade jobs and deliver good wage outcomes
and also training outcomes for our workers.

00:24:24.276 --> 00:24:27.636
Another NTUC initiative is AI Reddit SG,

00:24:27.956 --> 00:24:33.876
which we launched in February 2026.
This initiative focuses on three areas training

00:24:33.876 --> 00:24:37.636
and upskilling workers through structured AI pathways,

00:24:38.236 --> 00:24:43.356
supporting firms in business
transformation and job redesign through the CTC schemes,

00:24:43.716 --> 00:24:49.836
and improving job matching so that our workers
can benefit from the evolving roles as a result of AI.

00:24:50.716 --> 00:24:58.676
This integrated approach is reflected in NTUC AWS
partnership that was signed just last month.

00:24:59.396 --> 00:25:00.000
Under this partnership with AWS as the lead multiplier,

